Placeholder directory for Who Am I? React components:
  - CharacterBoard.tsx   (25-character grid, tap to cross off)
  - QuestionLog.tsx      (scrollable public Q&A history)
  - TurnControls.tsx     (ask question / answer yes-no / guess / "I'm Done")
  - ResultsRecap.tsx     (end-of-game recap screen)
Populated when the game module is built.
